---
// Shared empty state: one centered line of mono text plus the message slot
// (05-design-spec.md §8 "Empty state" — restyled only, props unchanged: no
// props, one slot). No icon and no retry button: an empty listing is a
// content gap, not a failed request.
---

<p class="empty-state">
  <slot />
</p>

<style>
  .empty-state {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0;
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-4);
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-meta);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
</style>
